# The port menu opened mid-match silences the cues: in the debug VS match
# on Final Destination, Link (player 1) against Mario (player 2), a human
# slot with no input who stands still. F1 stops every sounding voice just
# before the menu's opening, nothing starts while it is open, and after
# "Back to game" the first tick starts the cues again from the match as it
# stands. Then Link runs off the left edge, the menu opens again over the
# gap and B closes it, and the gap warning starts again since he still
# hangs over the gap.
# Run from Git Bash with the debug match switches, cues on, and accessibility
# on but muted, as run_level.py runs it:
#   MELEE_DEBUG_VS=1 MELEE_DEBUG_VS_STOCKS=2 MELEE_A11Y_CUES=1 \
#     python tools/a11y/drive.py --muted tools/a11y/match_port_menu.drive
# drive.py cannot fail on a line too many: run_level.py fails the run on a
# cue start or stop logged between an opening and its "Back to game".

# Start on the title screen goes straight into the debug match.
wait "state 0 scene 0$"
press Start until "boot scene: state \d+ scene 2$"

# Both position cues start at GO, Link standing at x = -60.
wait 'cue your position start pan -0\.35 pitch 1\.07 ' 60
wait 'cue opponent position start '
sleep 1

# F1: each voice stops, then the opening, on the same frame.
key F1
wait 'cue your position stop '
wait 'cue opponent position stop '
wait '"PC settings\. Graphics, tab, selected, 1 of 5\. Left and right to switch tabs"$'
sleep 1.5

# Escape: "Back to game", then the first tick starts both cues again where
# Link still stands.
key Escape
wait '"Back to game"$'
wait 'cue your position start pan -0\.35 pitch 1\.07 '
wait 'cue opponent position start '
sleep 1

# A dash off the left edge: the gap warning starts past it.
press Left 450
wait 'cue gap start pan 0\.00 pitch 1\.00 gain 1\.00$' 5

# F1 over the gap stops it too; the gamepad's B closes the menu, and the gap
# warning starts again, Link still over the gap.
key F1
wait 'cue gap stop '
wait '"PC settings\. Graphics, tab, selected, 1 of 5\. '
sleep 1.5
gamepad b
wait '"Back to game"$'
wait 'cue gap start pan 0\.00 pitch 1\.00 gain 1\.00$'
sleep 0.5
